    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it feels deeper than just being tired. like, if you really look at the math of it, we're just biological accidents on a rock that's eventually gonna be swallowed by the sun anyway. why do we keep pretending that our little lives and our feelings actually mean something in the long run? it feels like we're all just performing a play for an empty theater.",
